Dark Sun: Wake of the Ravager Redux
A clean-room MonoGame restoration of SSI's 1994 computer role-playing game
Dark Sun: Wake of the Ravager. A separate Asset Extractor requires a supported,
legally owned GOG copy and creates a local asset pack; no original resources are
distributed with this project.

